&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower global trade by ensuring seamless, compliant customs operations across EMEA.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Flexport&#39;s dynamic Customs team, a critical pillar in our mission to make global trade easier for everyone. As a Customs Analyst, you&#39;ll work day-to-day with our operations, sales, and legal teams, as well as directly with clients, ensuring their shipments navigate complex international regulations smoothly. You&#39;ll be instrumental in processing customs declarations, classifying goods, and resolving real-time challenges that arise in the fast-paced world of cross-border logistics. This role offers a unique chance to contribute to a culture of precision and proactive problem-solving, directly impacting our clients&#39; success and Flexport&#39;s growth in a heavily regulated industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and submit customs declarations accurately and efficiently for clients across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct tariff classification of goods and ensure correct valuation in compliance with local and international regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal operations teams and external clients to gather necessary documentation and resolve customs-related queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and interpret changes in customs laws and regulations, advising on potential impacts and necessary adjustments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate complex customs issues to senior analysts or management, contributing to timely resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain meticulous records and ensure all customs activities adhere to Flexport&#39;s high standards of compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ year of experience in customs brokerage, trade compliance, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of customs procedures, import/export regulations, and tariff classification within the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and strong analytical skills to navigate complex documentation and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, capable of effectively interacting with clients and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in customs declaration software and Microsoft Office Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &#39;compliance first&#39; attitude to keep our regulators happy and enthusiastic about Flexport since we operate in a heavily regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch food delivery 4 days a week incl. vegetarian options, a salad bar and special menu options, plus breakfast options, snacks, soft drinks and barista coffee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance:&amp;nbsp; employee contribution part is covered by Flexport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
